WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.426
O ye Liptako ka mara ye. O ye tarikiko dɔ lo ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.792
Saan 1900 wagati daminɛ na, Dori mara la Sahɛli jamana na.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.898
Jamana fla le bɛ yan: sagadɛndɛbagaw ni o ta bɛganw, ani sɛnɛkɛlaw ni o ka forow.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.432
Dugukolo ka ɲi k'u bɛɛ balo.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.728
Nka loon dɔ, u ye sagakulu dɔ kunbɛn foro dɔ la.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.400
I ka sagakuruw ye ne ka suman ɲimi!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.900
I ka forow b'an ka siraw datugu!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.424
Aw ye bɔ yan!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.548
O sogo ye ne ta ye sisan.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.528
O kuntigi min tun dimininba lo, ale ka bɛgan dɔ mina k'a faga.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.400
Jamanatigi dɔ b'a ta sotigiw lajɛn.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.452
An tɛ se ka sɔn o ma tugun.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.400
An ka delili kɛ sanni an ka taga.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.380
Ala y'a to i senw ni i jusukun bɛɛ ye tagama.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:20.092
O ye kɛlɛ lo ye. O kɔ, u y'a fɔ ko: "Aw ye boliw ta ka taga kɛlɛ kɛ".

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.890
O bɛɛ banna! Ne be ban.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.648
Kuntigiba be sɔn.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.900
Jamana dɔ sigira: Liptako mara.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.976
O yɔrɔ lo ye Liptako mara ka sigiyɔrɔ ye.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.480
Fanga kura dɔ sigira o mara kan.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:39.356
Dori kɛra duguba ye. A ka dugu lamini na, lɔgɔfiyɛ kɛra yɔrɔjan. O kɔ, sagaw ni baw bɔra yɔrɔjan ka na.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:10.930
Bi, Dori ye duguba dɔ ye Sahɛli jamana na. A ka maana be to k'a lakali.
